          "reason": "The forward characterization is not asserted for a supplied increasing nonnegative measurable sequence on an arbitrary measure space, including infinite integral limits and the stated arithmetic. The displayed conclusion is the stated conditional calculation or implication; no recovery of its model hypotheses from the result is claimed."
