          "evidence": "Statement and proof 2.1 admit a singleton index or a single supplied state/particle in a measurable energy, a positive finite partition function and compact-parameter integrable envelopes for the two canonical derivatives. The coordinate identity, positive normalization or cell estimate is the same stated formula; no separate multi-index lower bound is required."
        },
        {
          "case": "degenerate",
