      "derivations": [
        {
          "id": "step-1-1",
          "claim": "Apply [F2] to $s_B$ at $u_0$ with increment $-E_i$. It gives $s_B(u_0-E_i)=s_B(u_0)-\\beta E_i+r_i$ where $|r_i|\\le M E_i^2/2\\le\\delta$.",
