          "claim": "For $x\\in[e^{-2\\delta},e^{2\\delta}]$, $|x-1|\\le e^{2\\delta}-1$. Thus $\\sum_i|p_i-q_i|=\\sum_iq_i|p_i/q_i-1|\\le(e^{2\\delta}-1)\\sum_iq_i=e^{2\\delta}-1$. The case $\\delta=0$ is included and gives equality of the laws.",
